# FarmPro Monitoring System

This project implements a full monitoring stack using Prometheus and Grafana on Kubernetes.

## Features
- Real-time metrics collection (Prometheus)
- Visualization dashboards (Grafana)
- Kubernetes deployment
- Microservices monitoring

## Tech Stack
- Kubernetes
- Docker
- Prometheus
- Grafana

## Architecture
App → Prometheus → Grafana → Alerts